('dirt', '/dә:t/', 'n. 污垢, 泥土 [化] 污垢', 'n', 'He will make you eat dirt.', '他会让你吃灰的。', 'CET4', 0),
('disable', '/dis''eibl/', 'vt. 使失去能力, 使残废, (律)使无资格 [计] 使无效, 禁止, 关闭', 'vt', 'I wish I could figure out how to disable comments on my blog.', '但愿我能找到在我的博客上屏蔽评论的办法。', 'CET4', 0),
('disadvantage', '/.disәd''vɑ:ntidʒ/', 'n. 缺点, 不利, 坏处', 'n', 'The comparison between the two was to his disadvantage.', '两相比较，他那边的形势更不利一些。', 'CET4', 0),
('disagree', '/.disә''gri:/', 'vi. 不一致, 不适宜 [法] 抵触, 不同意, 争执', 'vi', 'I disagree with you.', '我不同意你的看法。', 'CET4', 0),
('disappear', '/.disә''piә/', 'vi. 消失, 不见', 'vi', 'The point we must clarify here is that the lines between amateur and professional in sport are beginning to disappear.', '我们必须阐明这个观点，在运动项目上，业余选手和专业选手的界限开始消失了。', 'CET4', 0),
('disappoint', '/.disә''pɒint/', 'vt. 使失望', 'vt', 'Don''t disappoint him.', '别让他失望。', 'CET4', 0),
('disapprove', '/.disә''pru:v/', 'v. 不赞成', 'v', '', '', 'CET4', 0),
('disaster', '/di''zɑ:stә/', 'n. 灾祸, 不幸, 彻底失败', 'n', 'Slight inattention can cause a great disaster.', '失之毫厘，谬之千里。', 'CET4', 0),
('discard', '/dis''kɑ:d/', 'vt. 丢弃, 抛弃 vi. 垫牌 n. 垫牌, 抛弃', 'vt', 'Discard a card.', '丢弃一张手牌。', 'CET4', 0),
('discharge', '/dis''tʃɑ:dʒ/', 'vt. 卸下, 放出, 解雇, 拔染, 履行, 放电 vi. 卸货, 流出 n. 卸货, 流出, 放电', 'vt', 'The crowd obstructed the police in the discharge of their duties.', '群众妨碍了警员执行任务。', 'CET4', 0),
('discipline', '/''disiplin/', 'n. 训练, 纪律 vt. 训练, 惩罚', 'n', 'Translation is a scholarly discipline.', '翻译是一门学问。', 'CET4', 0),
('disclose', '/dis''klәuz/', 'vt. 揭露, 透露 [法] 揭发, 揭露, 公开', 'vt', 'Some companies have already voluntarily disclosed similar information .', '一些公司已经主动透露了类似的信息。', 'CET4', 0),
('discount', '/''diskaunt/', 'n. 折扣, 贴现率 vt. 打折扣 vi. 贴现', 'n', 'Can you give me a discount?', '能给我打个折么？', 'CET4', 0),
('discourage', '/dis''kʌridʒ/', 'vt. 使气馁, 阻碍', 'vt', 'Aspirin may discourage tumour growth in some types of cancer.', '阿司匹林可能遏制某些恶性肿瘤的生长。', 'CET4', 0),
('discover', '/dis''kʌvә/', 'vt. 发现, 找到, 暴露 vi. 发现', 'vt', 'How foolish I was not to discover that simple lie!', '我竟然蠢得被这么简单的谎话骗倒了！', 'CET4', 0),
('discovery', '/dis''kʌvәri/', 'n. 发现, 被发现的事物 [法] 要求告知, 发现, 发觉', 'n', 'That discovery was quite accidental.', '那个发现纯属偶然。', 'CET4', 0),
('discrimination', '/dis.krimi''neiʃәn/', 'n. 差别, 岐视, 辨别力 [化] 鉴别', 'n', 'He fought against racial discrimination.', '他反对种族歧视。', 'CET4', 0),
('discussion', '/dis''kʌʃәn/', 'n. 讨论', 'n', 'Let''s carry on the discussion.', '让我们进行讨论。', 'CET4', 0),
('disease', '/di''zi:z/', 'n. 疾病, 弊病 [医] [疾]病', 'n', 'Life is a fatal sexually transmitted disease.', '生命是一种致命的性传染病。', 'CET4', 0),
('disguise', '/dis''gaiz/', 'n. 假面目, 假装 vt. 假装, 隐瞒', 'n', 'Can''t you just picture Ed in woman''s disguise?', '想像一下 Ed 男扮女装之后会变成甚么样子。', 'CET4', 0),
('disgust', '/dis''gʌst/', 'n. 厌恶, 嫌恶 vi. 令人厌恶 vt. 使作呕', 'n', 'Joan looked at him with disgust.', '琼厌恶地看着他。', 'CET4', 0),
('dishonour', '/dis''ɔnә/', 'n. 不名誉, 使人丢脸的人/事, 耻辱, 不光彩 vt. 使丧失名誉, 使受耻辱, 使丢脸, 奸污, 拒收, 无法偿付, 拒付', 'n', 'You’ve brought enough dishonour on your family already without causing any more trouble.', '你惹的麻烦已经让你的家人够丢脸的了，不用再添乱了。', 'CET4', 0),
('disk', '/disk/', 'n. 圆盘, 磁盘 [计] 磁盘', 'n', 'I''ve formatted your hard disk by mistake.', '我不小心格式化了你的硬盘。', 'CET4', 0),
('dislike', '/dis''laik/', 'n. 嫌恶 vt. 讨厌, 不喜欢', 'n', 'I dislike being alone.', '我不喜欢独处。', 'CET4', 0),
('dismiss', '/dis''mis/', 'vt. 解散, 开除, 解职 vi. 解散 [计] 解散', 'vt', 'By turning the page, we can dismiss the characters in a book without fear of hurting their feelings.', '书页翻动之间，我们可以对书中的人物不予理会而不伤及他们的情感。', 'CET4', 0),
('disorder', '/dis''ɒ:dә/', 'n. 杂乱, 混乱 vt. 扰乱, 使失调', 'n', 'His room was in disorder.', '他的房间乱七八糟。', 'CET4', 0),
('display', '/dis''plei/', 'n. 显示, 陈列, 炫耀, 显示器 vt. 陈列, 显示, 表现, 夸示 [计] 显示器; 显示', 'n', 'Sociopaths rarely display remorse or feelings of guilt for their crimes.', '反社会者极少为他们的罪行显露懊悔或有罪恶的感觉。', 'CET4', 0),
('displease', '/dis''pli:z/', 'v. 使不愉快, 使(人)生气', 'v', 'Are you displeased with my work?', '你对我的工作不满意吗？', 'CET4', 0),
('disposal', '/dis''pәuzәl/', 'n. 丢掉, 处理, 排列, 销毁, 布置 [医] 处理, 处置', 'n', 'My car is at your disposal.', '你可以随便用我的车。', 'CET4', 0),
('dispose', '/dis''pәuz/', 'vt. 处理, 排列, 布置 vi. 处置', 'vt', 'the difficulties of disposing of nuclear waste', '处理核废料的困难', 'CET4', 0),
('dispute', '/dis''pju:t/', 'n. 争论 v. 争论', 'n', 'It is beyond dispute that advances in medicine have enabled people to live longer.', '医学的发展使人们更加长寿，这是无可置疑的。', 'CET4', 0),
('dissatisfy', '/dis''sætisfai/', 'vt. 使感觉不满, 不满足', 'vt', 'You have the ability to either satisfy or dissatisfy them when you contact them.', '在与顾客接触的时候，你就具有使顾客满意或者不满意的能力。', 'CET4', 0),
('dissolve', '/di''zɒlv/', 'v. 溶解, 解散', 'v', 'Stir until the sugar dissolves.', '一直搅拌到糖溶解掉。', 'CET4', 0),
('distance', '/''distәns/', 'n. 距离, 远方, 遥远 [计] 位距', 'n', 'I can''t judge distance.', '我无法判断距离。', 'CET4', 0),
('distant', '/''distәnt/', 'a. 远的, 疏远的 [经] 远期的', 'adj', 'We saw the gleam of a distant lighthouse.', '我们看到了远方灯塔的微光。', 'CET4', 0),
('distinct', '/dis''tiŋkt/', 'a. 清楚的, 显著的, 不同的', 'adj', 'Those two ideas are quite distinct.', '这完全是两个不同的观点。', 'CET4', 0),
('distinction', '/dis''tiŋkʃәn/', 'n. 区别', 'n', 'He makes no distinction between right and wrong.', '他是非不分。', 'CET4', 0),
('distinguish', '/dis''tiŋgwiʃ/', 'v. 区别, 辨别', 'v', 'You should distinguish between right and wrong.', '你需要区分善与恶。', 'CET4', 0),
('distress', '/di''stres/', 'n. 苦恼, 贫困, 痛苦 vt. 使苦恼 a. 亏本出售的', 'n', 'The dream had distressed her greatly.', '这场梦使她深感不安。', 'CET4', 0),
('distribute', '/di''stribju:t/', 'vt. 分配, 散布, 分发 [经] 分配, 分发', 'vt', 'a man distributing leaflets to passers-by', '一个向路人派发传单的男子', 'CET4', 0),
('distribution', '/.distrә''bju:ʃәn/', 'n. 分配 [计] 分布', 'n', 'Ubuntu is a popular Linux distribution.', 'Ubuntu是一个流行的Linux发行版。', 'CET4', 0),
('district', '/''distrikt/', 'n. 区域, 地方 [医] 地区, 地段', 'n', 'Apples are produced in this district.', '这是一个产苹果的地区。', 'CET4', 0),
('disturb', '/dis''tә:b/', 'vt. 扰乱, 妨碍, 使不安 [法] 滋扰, 扰乱', 'vt', 'I''ll do my best not to disturb your studying.', '我会尽量不打扰你复习。', 'CET4', 0),
('ditch', '/ditʃ/', 'n. 沟渠 vt. 在...开沟 vi. 开沟', 'n', 'Tom was driving too fast on the bend and ended up in the ditch.', '汤姆拐弯儿拐得太快了，把车开到了水沟里。', 'CET4', 0),
('dive', '/daiv/', 'n. 潜水, 跳水 vi. 跳水, 俯冲, 猛冲 vt. 把...突然伸入', 'n', 'Diving off the cliffs is dangerous.', '从悬崖上跳水是很危险的。', 'CET4', 0),
('diverse', '/dai''vә:s/', 'a. 不同的, 变化多的', 'adj', 'It''s fertile land inhabited by diverse nations.', '这是一片肥沃的土地，居住著不同的民族。', 'CET4', 0),
('divide', '/di''vaid/', 'vi. 分开, 分配, 分裂 vt. 分, 分开, 分裂, 除 n. 分配, 分水岭 [计] 除', 'vi', 'Oceans do not so much divide the world as unite it.', '海洋不是将世界分隔开来，而是将世界连接起来', 'CET4', 0),
('division', '/di''viʒәn/', 'n. 分, 分开, 除法, 部门(如部、处、系等), 师 [计] 部分', 'n', 'The children haven''t studied division yet.', '孩子们还没上过除法。', 'CET4', 0),
('divorce', '/di''vɒ:s/', 'n. 离婚 vt. 与...离婚', 'n', 'When did you learn of Mary''s divorce?', '你什么时候获知玛丽离婚？', 'CET4', 0),
('dock', '/dɒk/', 'n. 码头, 船坞, 被告席, 尾巴的骨肉部分 vt. 使靠码头, 使(船)进港, 剪短 vi. 进港', 'n', 'A crowd was waiting at the dock to greet them.', '一群人在码头等着迎接他们。', 'CET4', 0),
('document', '/''dɒkjumәnt/', 'n. 文件, 公文, 文档 vt. 证明, 为...引证 [计] 文档', 'n', 'I hadn''t recognized the importance of this document until you told me about it.', '你告诉了我以后，我才知道这份文件有多重要。', 'CET4', 0),
('domestic', '/dәu''mestik/', 'a. 家庭的, 国内的, 驯养的 [医] 家庭的, 家用的', 'adj', '...over 100 domestic flights a day to 30 leading U.S. destinations.', '…每天飞往美国30个主要目的地的100多个国内航班。', 'CET4', 0),
('dominate', '/''dɒmineit/', 'v. 支配, 占优势', 'v', 'The industry is dominated by five multinational companies.', '这个行业受五家跨国公司控制。', 'CET4', 0),
('donkey', '/''dɒŋki/', 'n. 驴子, 笨蛋, 顽固者, 辅助发动机, 辅助泵', 'n', 'Jessie urged the little donkey forward.', '杰西鞭策小毛驴前进。', 'CET4', 0),
('dorm', '/dɒ:m/', 'n. 宿舍', 'n', 'Have you gotten used to living in the dorm?', '你习惯在宿舍生活了吗？', 'CET4', 0)
