('transportation', '/.trænspә''teiʃәn/', 'n. 运输, 输送, 交通车辆 [经] 运转, 运输, 运输费', 'n', 'This hotel is conveniently located in terms of public transportation.', '这间酒店的交通位置很方便。', 'CET4', 0),
